Subject: [PATCH 07/26] fix(banner): read swarm agents dir from DNK_AGENTS_DIR
 instead of absolute path

Removes the hardcoded /Users/... path to DNK_HUB so the banner survives the
move of agents into DNK-OS. Regenerated patch 0004 and the cumulative patch;
both apply cleanly on upstream 2bd378ed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019ggJJv6TCw5L8trqXPcBAw
